Subject: [BioC] problem with "just.gcrma" and a fix
In-Reply-To: <16741.32478.844000.408795@gargle.gargle.HOWL>
References: <16740.34600.603000.431107@gargle.gargle.HOWL>	<41656247.10503@med.umich.edu>
