In many cases, I manage to overcome this without bothering the systems
support people by starting R with the --internet2 option. 

1. Right click on the shortcut that starts R (usually on your desktop).
2. Go to Properties
3. Under Shortcuts tab, add '--internet2' to the existing path in
target. Mine looks like this after modification

	c:\R\rw1091\bin\Rgui.exe --internet2

4. Press Apply and OK
5. Click on the icon now and try again.

For further information you can read help("download.file"), the FAQ or
search past mailing list archives. 

Regards, Adai



